// With both Southshore badges, the museum trusts the player with its own
// wing fossil (the species table's wingfossil, Pebbleton museum).

## The back room

::bg{location="museum-lab" time="day"}
::auto{character="pebbletonKell" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@pebbletonKell: Ottoline and I have been arguing. She says the wing fossil belongs to the museum. I say it belongs to the sky.
@pebbletonKell{emotion="happy"}: I won. Well. She said "fine, if the child has both badges." And you do.
::auto{character="pebbletonCurator" anchor="left" action="enter"}
@pebbletonCurator: I said it very reluctantly. Please write it down that I was reluctant.
::sfx{sound="revive-machine"}
::vfx{type="whiteOut"}
@pebbletonKell{emotion="surprised"}: There. There! Look at it stretch!
::gift{species="wingfossil" level="10"}
@pebbletonCurator{emotion="happy"}: Well. I suppose the glass case was a bit small for it.
